{"URL format validation should be added before fetching, rather than relying on the check inside `import`": 0.43167170882225037, "Sanitize `raw_html` posts before returning them - the early return turns imported embed HTML into stored, unsanitized output": 0.9651766419410706, "`url` is interpolated directly into HTML without escaping, risking HTML injection - should use `ERB::Util.html_escape` or `CGI.escapeHTML` on the URL before interpolating": 0.9597758650779724, "`contents` is used without a nil check - `contents <<` will crash if nil": 0.8640329241752625}